    "innovation": "This paper surveys recent progress in Atlantic climate prediction, concluding that initializing models with observed ocean states, particularly thermohaline circulation anomalies driven by the NAO, underpins decadal prediction skill for the subpolar North Atlantic and its associated climate impacts.",
